skills/in-progress/setup-ts-deep-modules/SKILL.md:33: trailing whitespace.
[32m+[m[32m**Entry points, not a barrel.** Because the public surface is *every* root file, a package can expose several small entry points (`index.ts`, `client.ts`, `server.ts`) instead of funnelling everything through one giant `index.ts`. Barrel files that re-export a whole subtree are discouraged — keep entry points small and hide implementation in subfolders.[m[41m[m
