skills/in-progress/writing-fragments/SKILL.md:32: trailing whitespace.
[32m+[m[32m- A half-thought: "something about how X feels like Y, work this out later."[m[41m[m
skills/in-progress/writing-fragments/SKILL.md:33: trailing whitespace.
