[32m+[m[32m- **Use the glossary's own terms inside definitions.** Once a term is in the glossary, prefer it everywhere — including inside other definitions. This is what makes complex terms easier to grasp later.[m[41m[m
skills/productivity/teach/GLOSSARY-FORMAT.md:33: trailing whitespace.
